SUMMARY:Olive Oil Festival\, Achladia
LOCATION:Achladia\, Crete (Lasithi)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The olive village south of Sitia celebrates its oil on the evening of 9 August with dishes cooked in the new-season Sitia PDO oil and a Cretan kompania (Petros Maroulis in 2025)\, part of the Kornaria programme. Twenty minutes from Sitia\; the Minoan villa of Achladia is next to the village if you come early.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#achladia-olive-oil-festival-achladia
